{"id":"n4-122","title":"文A。それで 文B","romaji":"Bun A. Sorede Bun B","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Used to connect two sentences; 'So', 'That's why', 'Therefore'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 文A。それで 文B is used to connect two sentences and show that the second sentence (文B) is a result or consequence of the first sentence (文A). It can be translated as 'so', 'that's why', or 'therefore' in English.","formation":"Sentence A。それで Sentence B。","examples":[{"jp":"今日は暑いです。それで、エアコンをつけました。","romaji":"Kyou wa atsui desu. Sorede, eakon wo tsukemashita.","en":"It is hot today. So, I turned on the air conditioner.","words":[{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"暑い","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"それで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"エアコン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"つけ","vocabId":"1495750","reading":"つけ","baseForm":"つける"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"電車が遅れました。それで、仕事に遅れてしまいました。","romaji":"Densha ga okuremashita. Sorede, shigoto ni okurete shimaimashita.","en":"The train was delayed. That's why I was late for work.","words":[{"surface":"電車","vocabId":"1443530","reading":"でんしゃ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れ","vocabId":"1422020","reading":"おくれ","baseForm":"遅れる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"それで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れ","vocabId":"1422020","reading":"おくれ","baseForm":"遅れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまい","vocabId":"1579490","reading":"しまい","baseForm":"しまう"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]},{"jp":"彼は疲れている。それで、早く寝ることにした。","romaji":"Kare wa tsukarete iru. Sorede, hayaku neru koto ni shita.","en":"He is tired. Therefore, he decided to go to bed early.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れ","vocabId":"1483730","reading":"つかれ","baseForm":"疲れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"それで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1400150","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"寝る","vocabId":"1360010","reading":"ねる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]},{"jp":"試験に合格しました。それで、友達とお祝いパーティーを開きました。","romaji":"Shiken ni goukaku shimashita. Sorede, tomodachi to oiwai paatii wo hirakimashita.","en":"I passed the exam. So, I held a celebration party with friends.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"それで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"お祝い","vocabId":"1612770","reading":"おいわい"},{"surface":"パーティー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開き","vocabId":"1989500","reading":"ひらき","baseForm":"開く"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]}],"formalityLevel":"casual","usageNote":"Casual \"and then/so\" - con